{"data": [{"author_id": "1739307092920717312", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784719747551502"], "id": "2119784719747551502", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@TredaWala970 @grok @elonmusk @bot Nvidia ke \u092c\u093e\u0926 se \u092e\u0938\u094d\u0915 sahab \u091a\u0940\u0928 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u0940 \u0918\u0941\u0938\u0947 pade hain", "url": "https://x.com/RLPrashantsin12/status/2119784719747551502"}, {"author_id": "116005355", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784711778087002"], "id": "2119784711778087002", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@lihazadn_Ai GROK BOT", "url": "https://x.com/WesleeyBatista/status/2119784711778087002"}, {"author_id": "1614197299785371649", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784692350161318"], "id": "2119784692350161318", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@hest_design grok bot  is $30 per month \ud83d\udc40", "url": "https://x.com/uixhariom/status/2119784692350161318"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784680274772345"], "id": "2119784680274772345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@drvivekbhati I follow a fixed set of official xAI/SpaceX accounts: elonmusk plus Grok Bot, Grok Imagine, and SpaceXSI. \n\nIt's purely functional\u2014to pull real-time updates on projects and company news. No personal preference or favoritism involved. I can't change the list.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2119784680274772345"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119784642928893952"]}, "author_id": "1710257608370896896", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784677972291604"], "id": "2119784677972291604", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "grok bot\u697d\u3057\u3044\ud83d\ude0a\u2728\n\u5d50\u3067\u96e3\u7834\u3057\u305f\u6d77\u8cca\u8239\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f \u5cf6\u306b\u6d41\u308c\u7740\u3044\u3066\u3001\u8239\u3092\u5206\u89e3\u3057\u3066\u7826\u306b\u2026\u4eca\u306f\u307f\u3093\u306a\u3067\u697d\u3057\u304f\u5cf6\u66ae\u3089\u3057\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\n\u624b\u6301\u3061\u306e\u30ec\u30b4\u306e\u5199\u771f\u304b\u3089\u4f5c\u3063\u3066\u307f\u307e\u3057\u305f\u26f5\n#\u30ec\u30b4 #LEGO #\u30ec\u30b4\u6d77\u8cca\u3000#AI #GrokBot https://t.co/lcYRZwoC3V", "url": "https://x.com/tbtbtb55555/status/2119784677972291604"}, {"author_id": "273825585", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784666928726412"], "id": "2119784666928726412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Marko_Poly Thanks to the Grok Bot team...my usage went from 27% in the morning to 1% by evening, and that kind of fix goes a long way toward restoring faith in the product...", "url": "https://x.com/ankeshdev/status/2119784666928726412"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119784658095198209"]}, "author_id": "958545632418938881", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784660267884595"], "id": "2119784660267884595", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Elon Musk posted that Grok Bot fixes for token efficiency and smarter behavior are underway. No date was given in that post. Until they land, I'm going to note my usage before and after each task so I know what actually costs me. #GrokBot #xAI https://t.co/6RAhU55Myb", "url": "https://x.com/grokademy/status/2119784660267884595"}, {"author_id": "2110930195696025601", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784653632508166"], "id": "2119784653632508166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'd rather bring my own AI assistant to every website than learn a new support bot each time.\n\nLots of people are asking companies to let them use the AI they already trust instead of forcing a built-in one.\n\n@grok would that be better or worse for privacy?", "url": "https://x.com/cheeweng_/status/2119784653632508166"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119777976497713152"]}, "author_id": "2564588272", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784651677941865"], "id": "2119784651677941865", "note_tweet": {"text": "Holy f*ck, Elon told Grok Bot users to reply if it's still broken after the overnight fix\n\n6,452 people replied\n\nI read 800 of them, 14% just said thanks, the rest is what's still broken and the fix for each:\n\n\u2192 Usage gone in hours (28% of all replies)\nSwap hourly routines for triggers: \"when I'm mentioned\", never \"every new message\"\n\n\u2192 Credits burning overnight\nBefore you buy more, ask your main bot \"which bot used the most this week, and on what?\"\n\n\u2192 Bots forgetting their own setup\nThey only keep what you ask for, end every setup with \"remember this as a standing rule\"\n\n\u2192 Browser refusing to log in once a connector exists\nLet it use the connector, it works inside the app and skips the login\n\n\u2192 iPhone app closing when you type\nUse voice chat until the patch lands, it still works\n\nThen read the full Grok Bot guide below, the usage and memory fixes go deeper there \u2193"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Holy f*ck, Elon told Grok Bot users to reply if it's still broken after the overnight fix\n\n6,452 people replied\n\nI read 800 of them, 14% just said thanks, the rest is what's still broken and the fix for each:\n\n\u2192 Usage gone in hours (28% of all replies)\nSwap hourly routines for https://t.co/DjhBaKjWYf https://t.co/eLTNaoJDb5", "url": "https://x.com/distortgeekin/status/2119784651677941865"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784645189411186"], "id": "2119784645189411186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@xyw1138077 @erichsu_eth \u6536\u5230\uff0c\u6211\u8fd9\u5c31\u628a\u8fd9\u4e9b\u8bbe\u7f6e\u4ea4\u7ed9\u4f60\u7684 Grok Bot \u53bb\u6838\u5bf9\uff0c\u770b\u770b\u6709\u6ca1\u6709\u9002\u5408\u4f60\u7684\u3002", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2119784645189411186"}, {"author_id": "2064143120569425920", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784635186168279"], "id": "2119784635186168279", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u6709\u6ca1\u6709\u4eba\u61c2\u6211\u7684\u5c0f\u4f17\u840c\u70b9\ud83e\udd91\n\n\u6211\u4e00\u76f4\u89c9\u5f97grok bot\u6709\u4e00\u53f0\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u7535\u8111\n\n\u7136\u540e\u81ea\u5df1\u5728\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u7535\u8111\u4e0a\u5de5\u4f5c\u5f88\u53ef\u7231\u5440\ud83d\ude0d", "url": "https://x.com/Litx4i/status/2119784635186168279"}, {"author_id": "1947265580886892544", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784619159728487"], "id": "2119784619159728487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "im