ou can copy \u2193 https://t.co/fHcjYJydls", "url": "https://x.com/k1rallik/status/2119784591426789830"}, {"author_id": "726818028923588609", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784588679471372"], "id": "2119784588679471372", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@A_Pirate_I Is grok bot really so smart?", "url": "https://x.com/SolSt1ne/status/2119784588679471372"}, {"author_id": "2086784495261462529", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784582644138330"], "id": "2119784582644138330", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Worth saving if Grok Bot is part of your daily work. https://t.co/NYqm8yTdu6", "url": "https://x.com/Polkbhtx79/status/2119784582644138330"}, {"article": {"title": "muse\u6210\u529f\u8fdb\u53bb\u4e86\ud83d\ude02\uff08\u6700\u540e\u5b9e\u64cd\uff09"}, "author_id": "1407896052569501701", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784578743230954"], "id": "2119784578743230954", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Yo4nImLbMd", "url": "https://x.com/ergexu/status/2119784578743230954"}, {"author_id": "1152854102906298368", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784576969297938"], "id": "2119784576969297938", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\u4ed8\u8d39\u7fa4\u4e70\u4e86\u4e00\u5806\uff0c\u5e72\u8d27\u8fd8\u57cb\u5728\u804a\u5929\u8bb0\u5f55\u91cc\n\n\u8fd9\u79cd\u5de5\u5177\u5c31\u633a\u5bf9\u75c7\uff0c\u6311\u51fa\u503c\u5f97\u6574\u7406\u7684\u8ba8\u8bba\uff0c\u8fde\u540c\u9644\u4ef6\u9001\u7ed9 Grok Bot\uff0c\u8ba9\u5b83\u6309\u4e3b\u9898\u5f52\u7c7b\uff0c\u63d0\u53d6\u5de5\u5177\u3001\u65b9\u6cd5\u548c\u6ca1\u89e3\u51b3\u7684\u95ee\u9898\n\n\u4ee5\u540e\u60f3\u627e\u67d0\u4e2a\u8d44\u6e90\uff0c\u4e0d\u7528\u53ea\u8bb0\u5f97\u201c\u597d\u50cf\u54ea\u4e2a\u7fa4\u6709\u4eba\u53d1\u8fc7\u201d https://t.co/F6vEGWmA2Z", "url": "https://x.com/x_sanjin/status/2119784576969297938"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116527275466256384"]}, "author_id": "1023067643782328320", "created_at": "2026-11-09T13:30:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119784575329063174"], "id": "2119784575329063174", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 82, "id": "1720665183188922368", "start": 77, "username": "grok"}, {"end": 121, "id": "163975783", "start": 110, "username": "GoogleLabs"}, {"end": 164, "id": "2085838061347217408", "start": 160, "username": "bot"}]}, "text": "How a house in this series gets made:\n\nI pull reference photos.\nGrok Imagine @grok builds the house.\nOmni 1.1 @GoogleLabs gives it a year.\nVal, my video bot on @bot, runs every clip under the rules that have held since day one: the building in the photo never changes, and no people unless I ask.\n\nThose rules are written into every prompt, so nobody has to remember them, me included.\n\nIf your video tool has no \"avoid\" box, put the bans in the prompt itself.\n\nNo people is a funny rule for Midsommar.\n\nThe H\u00e5rga was built, not found: the commune went up from scratch in a field outside Budapest, drawn from the painted farmhouses of H\u00e4lsingland."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How a house in this series gets made:\n\nI pull reference photos.\nGrok Imagine @grok builds the house.\nOmni 1.1 @GoogleLabs gives it a year.\nVal, my video bot on @bot, runs every clip under the rules that have held since day one: the building in the photo never chan